    "query": "For Tesla ADAS recall campaigns whose defect summaries describe the same driver-assistance or automation-control problem as complaint narratives and an investigation report, what's the matched complaint count, dominant defect topic in {autopilot_misuse, unexpected_braking, steering_control, warning_or_supervision_gap, other}, and related investigation report IDs correspond to each campaign number?",
